vered by Srivijaya.<a href="http://www.zum.de/whkmla/region/seasia/xsrivijaya.html">EXTERNAL_INLINE_LINK: http://www.zum.de/whkmla/region/seasia/xsrivijaya.html </a> Total area of Indonesia (less West New Guinea) 1,500,000 km2. Medang had about 10% of this area. On basis of area we could estimate for Medang: 280,000 in 700 CE, 300,000 in 800 CE, 340,000 in 900 CE, 375,000 in 1000 CE.\n                    '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2305, 'temperature': 0.2})
